Fixed: MatrixFree::get_face_active_fe_index() returned the cell vectorization
category instead of 0 without hp-adaptivity if
MatrixFree::AdditionalData::cell_vectorization_category was set, as opposed to
MatrixFree::get_cell_active_fe_index(). The FEFaceEvaluation constructor taking
a face range and MatrixFreeTools::compute_diagonal() and
MatrixFreeTools::compute_matrix() with face integrals then accessed the shape
information out of bounds. Now, both functions return 0 without hp-adaptivity.
<br>
